---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${SITE.name}. Information about how we handle your personal data.`}
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">

    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">›</span>
      Privacy Policy
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          This privacy policy applies to <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>, a mobile van lock fitting
          service operating in and around Stoke-on-Trent, Staffordshire.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          We are the data controller for any personal information you provide to us.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          <strong>Contact:</strong><br />
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">{SITE.email}</a><br />
          Phone: <a href={SITE.phone.href} class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">{SITE.phone.display}</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. What Personal Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">
          When you use the quote request form on our website, we collect the following information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Phone number</li>
          <li>Email address (if provided)</li>
          <li>Postcode</li>
          <li>Van make, model, and year</li>
          <li>Details about the security work you require</li>
          <li>Any additional information you provide in the notes field</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">
          When you contact us directly by phone, email, or WhatsApp, we may also collect information
          you provide during that conversation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Why We Collect This Data</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">We use the information you provide to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Respond to your quote request or enquiry</li>
          <li>Provide a price for the work you've described</li>
          <li>Arrange a fitting appointment if you proceed</li>
          <li>Follow up on an open quote (within its 30-day validity period)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">
          <strong>Legal basis for processing:</strong> We process your data on the basis of your consent
          (when you submit the contact form) and/or our legitimate interest in responding to business
          enquiries.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. How We Store Your Data</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">
          Form submissions made via our website are processed by
          <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong> (our website hosting and form processing provider),
          which stores form submissions on its servers in the United States. Netlify is covered
          by appropriate data processing agreements and operates under EU/UK GDPR-compatible
          standard contractual clauses.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          When we reply to your enquiry, your contact details may be stored in our email inbox
          or on a personal device used by the business. We do not use a CRM system.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. How Long We Keep Your Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Quote request data: retained for up to 6 months, then deleted.</li>
          <li>Customer data (where a job is completed): retained for up to 3 years for warranty and business purposes, then deleted.</li>
          <li>Email correspondence: retained in line with standard email retention practices; deleted when no longer relevant.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">
          Under UK GDPR, you have the following rights:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Right of access:</strong> You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to rectification:</strong> You can ask us to correct any inaccurate data.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to erasure:</strong> You can ask us to delete your data, subject to any legal obligations we have to retain it.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to restrict processing:</strong> You can ask us to limit how we use your data.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to object:</strong> You can object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to data portability:</strong> You can request your data in a portable format.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">
          To exercise any of these rights, please contact us by email at
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">{SITE.email}</a>.
          We will respond within one month.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          If you are unhappy with how we handle your data, you have the right to complain to the
          <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">
            Information Commissioner's Office (ICO)
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">7. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Our website does not currently use tracking or analytics cookies. We use localStorage
          (stored only in your browser) to remember your cookie preference. This does not involve
          any data being sent to our servers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Please see our <a href="/cookies" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">Cookie Policy</a>
          for more details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page indicates
          when it was last revised. We encourage you to check this page periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about this privacy policy or how we handle your data, please
          contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">{SITE.email}</a></p>
          <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={SITE.phone.href} class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">{SITE.phone.display}</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Back link -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Back to home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
